  "solution": {
    "text": "As<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now, consider<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>principal</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>principal</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
